  "description": "The heiress of the Sungma Group, Na Mirae leads a relatively plush life. But after the death of her mother, the only thing that helps her get through the troubles of her household is art. Then she meets Ju Namyeob, a boy brimming with artistic talent, and the same love for art as herself. From two totally different worlds, they help each other fill the blank canvases of their lives. 2nd Lezhin Comics World Comic Contest Winner. \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
